{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28124","headline":"送于中丞使北蕃 · 雍陶","name":"送于中丞使北蕃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朔将引双旌，山遥碛雪平。\n经年通国信，计日得蕃情。\n野次依泉宿，沙中望火行。\n远鵰秋有力，寒马夜无声。\n看猎临胡帐，思乡见汉城。\n来春拥边骑，新草满归程。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"雍陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28124.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28124","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}